{"record_id": "EU-DVSA-AUDI-Q5-2016-7bb044c7", "source_id": "EU-DVSA-RCL", "region": "EU", "language": "EN", "source_type": "RECALL", "title": "召回: Reason for recall", "raw_text": "Reason for recall If the water drain in the area of the panoramic sunroof is not functioning properly water can seep into the vehicleï¿½s headliner. If sufficient water accumulates the foam adjacent to the pressure cylinder of the curtain airbag can become wet and cause the pressure cylinder to corrode. The corrosion can weaken the cylinder causing sudden pressure release possibly with fragments.", "published_at": "", "retrieved_at": "2026-08-14T20:13:37.372052+00:00", "manufacturer": "AUDI", "brand": "AUDI", "model": "Q5", "year": 2016, "component_raw": "", "failure_description": "If the water drain in the area of the panoramic sunroof is not functioning properly water can seep into the vehicleï¿½s headliner. If sufficient water accumulates the foam adjacent to the pressure cylinder of the curtain airbag can become wet and cause the pressure cylinder to corrode. The corrosion can weaken the cylinder causing sudden pressure release possibly with fragments.", "consequence_raw": "", "source_url": "https://www.check-vehicle-recalls.service.gov.uk/recall-type/vehicle/make/AUDI/model/Q5/year/2016/recalls", "official_confirmed": true, "content_hash": "1374c3273df7d17895c6d9209fb6e120", "parser_version": "v3.0-eu"}
